&ROOTUPTAKE
! Root kernel selection for the v15_s3_v4root variant (DSSAT-CSM 4.8.2.0).
!   root_kernel = 1 : frozen S1 dual-channel additive kinetics (default;
!                     this file absent reproduces S1 byte-for-byte)
!   root_kernel = 2 : v4-R2 simultaneous kernel -- membrane Michaelis-Menten
!                     at the root-surface concentration solved jointly with
!                     (mass flow + effective diffusion) supply (bisection)
! Engineering values follow 4864 research/n_integration_v2/stage5_engineering.nml
! and are UNCALIBRATED (not part of the PEST parameter domain).
!   root_v      g N / m root / d     membrane Vmax per unit root length
!   root_k      mg N / L water       membrane half-saturation constant
!   diffusion_k L water / m root / d effective diffusion conductance
! Placement: run directory (name RootUptake.nml), or any path exported as
! DSSAT_ROOT_UPTAKE_NML (used by calibration sandboxes).
 root_kernel   = 2
 root_v        = 0.0002
 root_k        = 10.0
 diffusion_k   = 0.005
/
